    ~ ending = "public"
    -> public_end
* [订下私约，先补陆家的钱，让这一季渡船继续。 # cid:end_quiet]
    ~ ending = "quiet"
    -> quiet_end
* {deposit && trust && rescued && confessed && consent} [以押金、公开账目和共同签责，试办众人之渡。 # cid:end_common]
    ~ ending = "common"
    -> common_end
